# Form Builder Rules

## Form Field Types
Supported types: text, textarea, number, email, select, radio, checkbox, date, file

## Form Builder Architecture
- Three-panel layout: palette (left w-48) | preview (center flex) | config (right w-72)
- Drag from palette to preview using @dnd-kit
- Click field in preview to select → show config in right panel
- Field order determined by sortable list position

## @dnd-kit Setup
```tsx
import { DndContext, closestCenter } from "@dnd-kit/core";
import { SortableContext, verticalListSortingStrategy, useSortable } from "@dnd-kit/sortable";
import { CSS } from "@dnd-kit/utilities";
```

## Dynamic Form Rendering
- Read FormField[] from service config
- Map each field.type to the correct shadcn component:
  - text → Input
  - textarea → Textarea
  - number → Input type="number"
  - email → Input type="email"
  - select → Select with SelectItem for each option
  - radio → RadioGroup with RadioGroupItem for each option
  - checkbox → multiple Checkbox components
  - date → Calendar with Popover
  - file → Input type="file"
- Handle form state with React useState<Record<string, unknown>>
- Validate required fields before submit

## Field Config Schema
```typescript
interface FormField {
  id: string;
  type: FieldType;
  label: string;
  placeholder?: string;
  required: boolean;
  options?: string[];
  order: number;
}
```
